 :record-author "whole-component port, GENERATED from the oracle's entity-specs table"

 :generated-not-hand-ported
 "The first two ports in this cohort were written by hand and the third
  (com-abb-robotics) walked into the failure that made a generator worth
  writing: com-aadhaar's expand-oracle selectors were carried over asking for a
  field the new entity does not have, which would have folded over nothing and
  gone green. Here every entity name, plural, id prefix, field list, required
  list, coercion pair and ref pair is DERIVED from src/accela/main.cljc's own
  entity-specs table, so that class cannot be carried.

  The generator is validated against the port that was executed: its tables for
  com-abb-robotics are byte-identical to the hand-written ones that were run
  and measured."

 :baseline-paths
