 :shape
 {:entities 6
  :root "Project"
  :ref-entity "Permit"
  :refs "projectId:Project -- ONE ref, so the expand fold runs once"
  :float-coercion :not-reached
  :note
  "Unlike com-abb-robotics, no spec here declares a :float coercion, so this
   component does not reach the blocked float arm at all -- the same position
   com-aave is in. And Permit carries a single ref, so the two-ref fold
   com-abb-robotics exercises is NOT exercised here. Both are recorded because
   a reader comparing green runs across the cohort would otherwise assume every
   pilot covers the same ground."}

